{"kind": "spear", "attachment": null, "findings": [{"level": "error", "title": "A spear has to be exactly 45 voxels long", "body": "Yours is 1. The game positions the shaft assuming that length.", "voxels": []}, {"level": "error", "title": "1 voxel is almost black", "body": "Trove's style guide asks for nothing darker than (10, 10, 10) - pure black reads as a hole in game. Use a dark grey instead.", "voxels": [2]}, {"level": "warning", "title": "This model stores no attachment point", "body": "Older blueprints (format v3/v4) don't record an origin, so there's nothing to check and nothing to show. The game positions these by other means.", "voxels": []}], "satisfied": ["A blueprint stores one material per voxel, so alpha-on-solid and specular-on-glass - two of the classic .qb mistakes - can't happen here."], "counts": {"error": 2, "warning": 1, "info": 0}}